    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 54,
        "text": "Have you decided on a course at the college yet?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2a5a08ac36900fb66024fe39b561e35e11167809bb8f38e6f30c33243935de14",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 60,
        "sourceEnd": 209,
        "text": "I have chosen the evening science course. I want to learn more about the river near my home, and the curriculum includes a project about local water.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f71f7ae320ff0a1ec98a10dae4836ae243f2a75fb23aa00986adf85736c43e82",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 216,
        "sourceEnd": 266,
        "text": "That sounds useful. Is the first lesson on Monday?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "aae28265661a9b0f53fc2b7bc9fae0ef9706ef0e9f1776c86d4bb4ad6522a71e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 272,
        "sourceEnd": 392,
        "text": "No, it is on Wednesday at seven. The adviser said the classroom is in the older building on campus, next to the library.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "30b11a6ce8de39a541001587f83454a0f299f1cd6ff7ae8642711fc6759285cb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 399,
        "sourceEnd": 434,
        "text": "What will you do in the first week?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "40559f46d99deab099b8faca7777d4ff4333bd4ff9adb1ff0d8c452f9183ff7b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 440,
        "sourceEnd": 570,
        "text": "We will hear a short lecture about asking clear questions. Then we will have a seminar to discuss possible topics in small groups.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "aa3dbbec732cd3a94273abb85b5a7c35fbf010dd6e08297e4b6de1facf6fb6a0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 577,
        "sourceEnd": 680,
        "text": "I enjoy reading about geography. I might join you to understand how the river changes through the town.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9dce1c9c78a9e3c1c57d5a4ce25b537bd143da8f7852581873ae3036d1a0c4b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 686,
        "sourceEnd": 789,
        "text": "Please do. The teacher also offers a tutorial on Friday for students who need help with the assignment.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3233cbc081c8171aa9ba3226ba3c897470601aa4951e39163cac27a3800155d1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 796,
        "sourceEnd": 829,
        "text": "What is the assignment? An essay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c8464588f6a5678dc0e41c2f1b4fcb72f130755305b030fb4adcbd923f14cba3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 835,
        "sourceEnd": 961,
        "text": "A short report. First we plan to do research using the library's books. Then we decide what information belongs in the report.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "26bdf48f225a0f395c810601a48e63c65e1d04feabb171fb4793f021d49d913c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 968,
        "sourceEnd": 1012,
        "text": "Will there be an experiment in a laboratory?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bd4e73d1ec3202ce9aecf289de45cf7f0da61f196a320e5685b5599a8c27aeba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1018,
        "sourceEnd": 1159,
        "text": "Not in the first week. Later, a biology teacher will show us how to observe water plants safely. A chemistry teacher will help another group.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0b64e5b06eab381e8a803a369576f52a78f040b1fa54e9e497f221d7c9698a3a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1166,
        "sourceEnd": 1269,
        "text": "I hope the homework is manageable. I work full time, and I want to avoid studying too late every night.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5487d969d267fe5f8e0b9f6b7bdc7e7d9abd1127d77d9b3dd74ec99b19bc2c53",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1275,
        "sourceEnd": 1405,
        "text": "The teacher recommends two short study periods a week. The final assessment is a project and a discussion, not a long examination.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "12a88870ded64af4e6aa2a09709bb2ddeb74686ee3ca89aec98051277faab66f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1412,
        "sourceEnd": 1456,
        "text": "Good. Do I need a university degree to join?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f9c38da4dbfdf0008a01df435d11a2c8be4eeec80cf6e239833351f6375ee792",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1462,
        "sourceEnd": 1597,
        "text": "No. A graduate I met said people with different levels of education are welcome. She also studied history and literature at the center.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e7c1dcec2be4847f1e9e079a9a7ca070e824e9140cdc20635a64c3dc137dd1ac",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1604,
        "sourceEnd": 1727,
        "text": "I will register tomorrow, then. I plan to finish reading the course description tonight and ask about the fee before I pay.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c1639dbc9136387c84bdf6c033f27f5aefc4d05c76fb0746d44c6d540eba8eba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1733,
        "sourceEnd": 1820,
        "text": "Great. I will bring my notebook on Wednesday so we can compare ideas after the lecture.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4115626e04b16148846e06660195a9c332f7ac69c12182f1bce61f9ff73009f9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
